was started by two apprentices from the drawing office.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club does not meet between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"Most chess club members take leave between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"The canteen is closed for cleaning between mid July and early September.\",\"line\":7,\"span\":\"The club does not meet between mid July and early September, because most members take leave and the canteen is closed for cleaning.\"},{\"text\":\"Chess club play resumes on the first Tuesday of term.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"Play resumes on the first Tuesday of term.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club members leave the boards set up rather than pack them away.\",\"line\":8,\"span\":\"Over the years the members have learned to leave the boards set up rather than pack them away.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club does not use a rating system.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Instead of a rating system, the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"Instead of a rating system, the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point.\"},{\"text\":\"Chess club members who win a game move up one place on the ladder.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Members who win a game move up one place, and the person they beat moves down one place.\"},{\"text\":\"A chess club member who loses a ladder game moves down one place.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"Members who win a game move up one place, and the person they beat moves down one place.\"},{\"text\":\"In one wet autumn the chess club was invited to play a county side.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side, and nobody had expected the invitation.\"},{\"text\":\"Nobody had expected the invitation to play the county side.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side, and nobody had expected the invitation.\"},{\"text\":\"One apprentice agreed to play on the top board against the county side at two days' notice.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"In a rush to field a full team, one apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice agreed to play in a rush to field a full team.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"In a rush to field a full team, one apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice.\"},{\"text\":\"It took the apprentice the whole weekend to prepare for the county match.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"It took him the whole weekend to prepare, and he studied openings he had never used.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice studied openings he had never used.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"It took him the whole weekend to prepare, and he studied openings he had never used.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice lost his notes on the train.\",\"line\":18,\"span\":\"He also lost his notes on the train.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice arrived on time for the county match.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"But he arrived on time.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice shook hands and sat down to play.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"He shook hands, sat down and played the quietest game of his life.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice played the quietest game of his life.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"He shook hands, sat down and played the quietest game of his life.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice's game in the county match was adjourned.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The arbiter counted the material when the game was adjourned.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice was a pawn ahead when the game was adjourned.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice offered a draw.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"The county side accepted the apprentice's offer of a draw.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"When the game was adjourned and the arbiter counted the material, the apprentice was a pawn ahead and offered a draw, which the county side accepted.\"},{\"text\":\"After the match, the county side gave the chess club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time.\",\"line\":24,\"span\":\"When the match was over, the county side gave the club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice travelled home after the county match.\",\"line\":25,\"span\":\"He travelled home and told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\"},{\"text\":\"The apprentice told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\",\"line\":25,\"span\":\"He travelled home and told everyone in the drawing office about the game until they asked him to stop.\"},{\"text\":\"The chess club eventually grew to thirty members.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"Eventually the club grew to thirty members, and from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\"},{\"text\":\"After the chess club grew to thirty members, the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"Eventually the club grew to thirty members, and from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday so that nobody had to stand.\"}]}","ttft_ms":14619,"type":"result","duration_ms":14657,"uuid":"b170add6-bad5-4b12-bb21-bb4a03c84ac0","ttft_stream_ms":1511,"time_to_request_ms":107,"first_content_frame_ms":1512,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
